  <p class="font-mono text-sm text-black/70 leading-relaxed">It has chai plus a shot of espresso, so more caffeine than either on its own. For someone who already drinks double espresso, it's comparable. For someone who doesn't normally drink coffee, it's noticeable.</p>
</div>
